# This mod is XML and textures only: no assembly, no Source/ directory, nothing
# to build. The compilation rules below are inherited convention, kept so the
# file reads the same as in the other mods, rather than a live need.
#
# The entry that earns its place is .claude/: a session worktree is a full copy
# of the repository it belongs to, hundreds of megabytes, and one has already
# landed inside a mod folder once.
#
# Two separate reasons for this file, and only the first is about git:
#
#   - The monorepo's own .gitignore used to cover all of this. It does not reach
#     here any more: this directory is a repository of its own, and the rules of
#     the one above it no longer apply.
#   - Steam does not read .gitignore at all. SteamUGC.SetItemContent takes the
#     junction's target directory as it stands on disk, with no filtering, so
#     anything sitting in the published folder is published. That is what Mod/ is
#     for: the junction points there, and everything else in this repository -
#     Art/, the docs, this file - stays out of reach by construction.

# Build intermediates.
.build/
Source/obj/
Source/bin/

# Claude Code session worktrees and local settings: each worktree is a full copy
# of the repository, and they are never shared.
.claude/

# Showcase notes: French working notes, deleted once Preview.png and ModIcon.png
# are done.
PROMPT_*.md

# Development environments.
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.csproj.user

# System.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
